[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Let's calculate this value using Python:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m ```python
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m import math
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m # Coefficients
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m a = 348
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m b = -396
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m # Maximum value of a*cos(theta) + b*sin(theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m max_value = math.sqrt(a**2 + b**2)
