[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m First, we substitute \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Simplifying the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[(75 + 117i)(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)] + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[75\cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta] + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[75\cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)] + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[75\cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)] + \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}{4(\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[75\cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)] + \frac{96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4[75\cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)] + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + i(300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta + i(36 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
