[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Then, we can express the given expression in terms of \(\theta\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Simplifying the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 4(75 + 117i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = 4[(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)] + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m To simplify the second term, we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta) + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4} = 24(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 4[(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)] + 24(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i[4(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta) + 24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta].
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
