[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m To maximize the real part, we need to maximize the expression \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\):
