[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Then, we can substitute \(z\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m First, let's simplify the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = (24 - 36i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta - i(24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 4((75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + (24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta - i(24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = (4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta) + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(4(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta) - (24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = (300 \cos \theta - 468 \sin \theta + 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta) + i(300 \sin \theta + 468 \cos \theta - 24 \sin \theta + 36 \cos \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
