[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Now we substitute these into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)}
