[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\). Then, \(\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}e^{-i\theta} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Now, we substitute \(z = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta + 117i \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos \theta - i \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta - 96i \sin \theta + 144i \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1606671)[0m Now, we add these two expressions together:
